   "title": "gmlx nodes: install",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "These gmlx nodes run the image model on a gmlx server on your Mac (Apple Silicon, M3 or newer). MOSS-Image samples 50 steps at cfg 3, two passes a step, so an image takes minutes. Its license is Apache-2.0.\n\nThe schedule is ComfyUI's: sgm_uniform after ModelSamplingSD3 at shift 5, with block 22 left out of the negative pass, as the OpenMOSS workflow has it. gmlx image and gmlx serve sample on the release's own schedule, so their images differ a little from this one.\n\n1. Install gmlx: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/installation.html\n2. Put the nodes into ComfyUI, then restart ComfyUI:\n\n   gmlx comfyui install\n\n3. Download the model:\n\n   gmlx pull moss-image\n\nGuide: https://asher.github.io/gmlx/comfyui.html"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
